       <div class="detail"><div class="product" id="firmware-name">ETCH FULL SYNTH / V1.38</div><p class="soft" id="firmware-sub">ETCH V1.38 preserves the V1.37 synth, MIDI-keyboard mode, presets, PJT27 storage and all prior functions. This release fixes an OTA compatibility restriction in the DEVICE firmware: it supports both the pinned ETCH/Felucca updater and the original M-VAVE V15 loader, but only when paired with the exact verified V15 flash image. To restore stock from V1.37 or older ETCH, install V1.38 first, reboot and then choose OFFICIAL V15. Physical restoration has not yet been verified on an FM1.</p>
